[CustomMessages]
installservicetask=Yambitsani Kolibri payekha pamene kompyuta yangoyaka
newerversioninstalled="Mtundu watsopano wa {#AppName} (%1) wayikidwa kale. Pulogalamu yoyikirayi ili ndi mtundu %2, womwe ndi wakale. Tsopano ndondomeko yoyikirayi itsekeka."
sameversioninstalled=Mtundu wa %1 uwu wayikidwa kale. Kodi mukufuna kukonza ndodomeko ya kuyikidwako poyikanso?
olderversioninstalled="Mtundu wakale wa {#AppName} (%1) wapezeka. Kodi mukufuna kukweza ku mtundu watsopano {#AppVersion}?"
confirmuninstalldata=Kodi mukufuna kuchotseratu data ya ogwiritsa ntchito a Kolibri? Izi zikuphatikizapo zinthu zonse zotsitsidwa, maakaunti a ogwiritsa ntchito, komanso zonse zokhudza momwe ntchito ikuyendera, ndipo izi sizingatheke kubwezeretsedwanso.
criticalerror=Pachitika vuto lalikulu poyesa kugwiritsa ntchito lamulo loikira pulogalamu: %1. Kuika pulogalamuyi sikupitilira.
commanderror=Lamulo loyikira pulogalamu lakanika kugwira ntchito moyenera: %1. Kodi ya Vuto: %2. Kuika pulogalamuyi sikungapitirire.
versionparseerror=Yakanika kufananiza mitundu ya pulogalamuyi chifukwa mtunduwu ndi osavomerezeka. Chonde chotsani mtundu wakale pamanja, kenako yesaninso.
migrationfailed=Ndondomeko yoyikira pulogalamuyi yalephera kusamutsa data ya wogwiritsa ntchito kuchokera kumalo akale (%1) kupita kumalo atsopano (%2). Data yanu sinasamutsidwe. Chonde lumikizanani ndi othandizira kuti akuthandizeni.
createdesktopicon=Pangani chizindikiro cha pa desikitopu
additionalicons=Zizindikiro zina:
launchprogram=Tsekulani %1
installationtype=Mtundu wa Kayikidwe:
